              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "Layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch2 class=\u0022govuk-heading-m\u0022\u003EAlt text\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBy default, the image node name is used to display the alt text. However, if the Alt Text has been set in the media library for the image, this value will be used instead.\u00A0\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
