              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "Layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch2 class=\u0022govuk-heading-m\u0022\u003EDecorative images\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETo make an image decorative, go to its settings and select the \u0027Decorative image\u0027 option.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
